# 9. C-01 genericity validation

The combined JUnit + Spring Framework + Apache Log4j validation demonstrates that MAYA can support multiple independent:

- PackageIdentity objects;
- ProjectIdentity objects;
- Evidence sets;
- authorities;
- Assertions;
- Decisions.

The combined validation verifies:

- no identifier collisions;
- no Evidence cross-contamination;
- no Decision cross-contamination;
- deterministic results across ingestion permutations;
- deterministic offline replay;
- fail-closed behavior;
- preservation of competing Assertions and Conflicts.

The generic pipeline therefore does not depend on hard-coded JUnit, Spring or Log4j semantics.

